<title>USA: IMC Global completes fertilizer deals.</title>
<headline>IMC Global completes fertilizer deals.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMC Global Inc said Monday its IMC AgriBusiness Inc has completed the acquisition of the fertilizer assets of Hutson's Ag Services Inc and Hutson Co Inc.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The two privately owned operations, which together form a major Midwestern retail farm center and storage terminal company, have annual revenues of about $100 million and are headquartered in Murray, Kentucky.</p>
<p>Shares of IMC Global, a crop nutrient company, were down one at 37-1/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
